,"_63":64,"_65":66},"type","links","field","originalImage","label","创作者原图","items",[67],{"_63":64,"_25":68},"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aibengineering/sprout-quest/main/docs/teaser.webp","text","mediaReviewed","截图来源核查","value","2026-10-20","language","en","image","gameplay","A combat frame from the creator’s portrait gameplay animation, fitted without cropping.","src","/GameMap/assets/media/learning/sprout-quest-claude.webp","alt","A small sword-wielding adventurer fights creatures on a forest path, with a portrait mobile touch joystick.","https://github.com/aibengineering/sprout-quest#readme","width",1280,"height",720,"credit","Creator-published screenshot","list","attribution","创作者记录中的客户端与模型",[94],"Claude Code","相关资源",[99,100,101],"resourceIds","section",{"_63":94,"_25":106},{"_63":104,"_25":105},{"_63":102,"_25":103},"Blender","/zh/resources/blender/","Three.js","/zh/resources/threejs/","/zh/resources/claude-code/","创作者开发记录",[110],"evidence",{"_63":111,"_25":112,"_113":114},"查看作者的 AI 使用说明","https://github.com/aibengineering/sprout-quest#how-it-was-built","note","README separates the original build from later human playtest/AI iteration; publishes source modules, generated models and runtime assets, plus a prompt summary. Source-checked; full reproduction not performed.","源码内容","complete project","项目源码",[119],{"_63":120,"_25":121,"_113":122},"查看完整游戏项目","https://github.com/aibengineering/sprout-quest","Complete game code, runtime GLBs/sprite atlases, Blender scripts and tests. bun install then bun run dev opens localhost:3000; normal builds use committed art and do not require Blender. No root LICENSE was found, so public source visibility does not establish broad reuse permission.","获取方式","playable","demo","试玩与运行",[128],{"_63":129,"_25":130,"_113":131},"Play Sprout Quest","https://aibengineering.github.io/sprout-quest/","Author-hosted browser adventure designed for portrait phones, with desktop keyboard controls and localStorage saves.","游戏平台","浏览器","指南形式","build log","tutorial","开发记录与教程",[139],{"_63":140,"_25":112,"_113":-7},"阅读作者的开发过程","研究这个工作流","ordered",true,[145,146,147,148],"Play the portrait-browser prologue and follow its first fight, gathering and forge tasks.","Read the build account to see how human phone playtests guided later Claude Code changes.","Run bun install and bun run dev; inspect the game modules, committed runtime assets and Blender builders.","Change one combat, crafting or story rule with an agent, then replay the affected progression and save flow.","AI 工作流与开发背景","作者称游戏、测试与 Blender 美术流程均由 Claude Code 根据自然语言要求完成；人类负责在手机上试玩并反馈。仓库同时提供运行素材和素材生成脚本，可以研究试玩反馈如何推动后续修改。","aiUse","guidance","创作方式","AI 生成（创作者归属）","category","provenance","方向","2D","track","metadata","资产制作工具",false,[102],"assetTools","引擎","Custom Canvas 2D + Three.js · TypeScript","engine","lead",[102],"2d","ai-generated",[145,146,147,148],{"_63":185,"_25":112,"_17":186},{"_63":129,"_25":130,"_17":124,"_113":131},{"_63":182,"_25":121,"_113":122,"_183":184},{"_63":181,"_25":112,"_113":114},[178,179,180],"claude-code","threejs","blender","Read the creator’s AI attribution","Open the complete game project","scope","complete-project","Read the creator’s build account","build-log",{"_188":189},"documents",{"_75":190,"_35":191},[193,197,198,199,196,200,201,202,203,204,205,206,207,208,209,210,211,212,213,214,215,216,217,218,219,220,221,222,223,224,225,226,227,228,229,230,231,195,232,194,233,234,235,236,237,238,239,240,241,242,243,244,245,246,247,248,249,250],[192,193,194,195,196],"reading-guide","practical-guide","level-design-skill","deployment","publishing-platforms","tutorials-and-demos","coding-agent-game-code","game-testing-library","agents-notes","engines-notes","game-ai-notes","cadle-repositories","world-model-notes","research-index","production-research-notes","engine-operation-contracts","production-work-orders","studio-production-case-studies","native-operation-details","production-debugging-contracts","production-coverage-gaps","genera